sequenceDiagram
    participant CC0 as fed0 cluster ctlr
    participant T0 as fed0 VCPointerTable
    participant Gossip
    participant T1 as fed1 VCPointerTable
    participant CC1 as fed1 cluster ctlr
    loop every ~30s
        CC0->>CC0: reconcile vc-a1..a4<br/>(Creating -> PendingHooks)
        CC0->>T0: republishVCLocationsIfChanged
        T0->>Gossip: VCLocation delta (vclock++)
        Gossip->>T1: applied via MergeReplicated
    end
    loop every ~30s
        CC1->>CC1: reconcile vc-b1..b4
        CC1->>T1: republishVCLocationsIfChanged
        T1->>Gossip: VCLocation delta (vclock++)
        Gossip->>T0: applied via MergeReplicated
    end
    Note over T0,T1: fed0 list-vcs now shows<br/>fed1's b-VCs as (foreign)<br/>+ vice versa
